{
  "title": "Honey Garlic Glazed Chicken Thighs",
  "description": "Sticky honey garlic chicken thighs deliver 32g of protein in a single skillet. These tender thighs are seared until golden and tossed in a savory-sweet glaze that comes together in minutes.",
  "cuisine": "American-Asian",
  "category": "Dinner",
